          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/what-we-do.jpg",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "A mile from the nearest village",
            "text": "<p>Melt is made at Backridge Farm, down Twitter Lane in Waddington, in the heart of the Ribble Valley. We moved into our first barn here in 2001 and have been here ever since – the llamas, geese, rescue hens and beehives in the fields outside the workshop doors give a rhythm to our working day.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "row_2": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/in-the-beginning.jpg",
            "caption": "",
            "heading": "Local by choice",
            "text": "<p>We have worked hard to source our raw materials close to home. Over 89% of what goes into a Melt candle, from the ingredients to the packaging, comes from Lancashire companies, with the balance from the UK.</p><p>Our fragrances are blended for Melt, and you won’t find them anywhere else.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        }
      },
